# Template for scripts/screenshot/run.sh: renders the distribution step's
# error state under OKDCTL_DEMO_RELEASES=fail. StaticVersionFetcher.Err
# resolves without network latency, so the error state is already showing
# by the time step 2 appears — no interaction beyond opening the step is
# needed to capture the empty state + retry ribbon.
Output out/@NAME@-distribution-fail.txt
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 0
Set LineHeight 1.0
Set LetterSpacing 1.0
Set Width @W@
Set Height @H@

Hide
Type `export PATH="$(dirname "$OKDCTL_DEMO_BIN"):$PATH" HOME="$OKDCTL_DEMO_HOME" OKDCTL_WIZARD_DEMO=1 OKDCTL_DEMO_RELEASES=fail; cd "$OKDCTL_DEMO_CWD"; clear`
Enter
Show

Type "okdctl deploy"
Sleep 450ms
Enter

Wait+Screen@10s /step 1 of 11/
Enter
Sleep 450ms

Wait+Screen@10s /step 2 of 11/
Sleep 450ms
Screenshot out/@NAME@-distribution-fail.png
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
